{"id":"0d412b656b2bbda0","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-partial-logic.md","title":"部分逻辑","display":"df-partial-logic — 部分逻辑","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-partial-logic","aliases":["91-df-partial-logic","91-df-partial-satisfaction","91-df-three-valued-logic"],"display":"df-partial-logic — 部分逻辑","depends_on":["[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","[[91-df-weak-kleene]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-partial-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-partial-logic</span><span>91-df-partial-satisfaction</span><span>91-df-three-valued-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-logic — 部分逻辑"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bf50594cf0328bc9\" href=\"?note=bf50594cf0328bc9\" title=\"91-df-weak-kleene\">91-df-weak-kleene</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-partial-logic-—-部分逻辑-$\\mathrm{PartLog}$\">df-partial-logic — 部分逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartLog}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartLog}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> (对象语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{3}=\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(\\mathbf{3}=\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (真、假与未定义构成的真值集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf M=(\\mathbf 3,\\neg_{\\mathbf M},\\land_{\\mathbf M},\n\\lor_{\\mathbf M},D)\">\\(\\mathbf M=(\\mathbf 3,\\neg_{\\mathbf M},\\land_{\\mathbf M},\n\\lor_{\\mathbf M},D)\\)</span> (给定三值逻辑矩阵，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\mathbf 3\">\\(D\\subseteq\\mathbf 3\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (保持矩阵运算的评估类)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartLog}(\\mathcal L,\\mathbf M,v)\\coloneqq\nv\\in\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\,\n\\bigl(\\vDash_{\\mathbf M,v}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow v(\\varphi)\\in D\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartLog}(\\mathcal L,\\mathbf M,v)\\coloneqq\nv\\in\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\,\n\\bigl(\\vDash_{\\mathbf M,v}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow v(\\varphi)\\in D\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{3}\">\\(\\mathbf{3}\\)</span> : 三值真值集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{t, f, u\\}\">\\(\\{t, f, u\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> : 真 (true)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> : 假 (false)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> : 未定义/间隙 (undefined/gap)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vDash_3\">\\(\\vDash_3\\)</span> : 三值满足关系</li>\n</ul>\n<p>部分逻辑只规定真值域和哪些值算作满足；联结词的递归真值条件还须由具体矩阵给出。例如强、弱 Kleene 的合取表不同：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\land \\psi\">\\(\\varphi \\land \\psi\\)</span> (强)</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\land \\psi\">\\(\\varphi \\land \\psi\\)</span> (弱)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>t</td>\n<td>t</td>\n<td>t</td>\n<td>t</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>t</td>\n<td>f</td>\n<td>f</td>\n<td>f</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>t</td>\n<td>u</td>\n<td>u</td>\n<td>u</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>u</td>\n<td>t</td>\n<td>u</td>\n<td>u</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>u</td>\n<td>f</td>\n<td>f</td>\n<td>u</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>u</td>\n<td>u</td>\n<td>u</td>\n<td>u</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>当评估的值域限制为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}\\)</span> 且联结词采用经典真值函数时，所得满足关系退化为经典二值语义；这不是简单地“添加排中律”所得。</p>\n<p>部分逻辑在真理理论中的应用：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用</th>\n<th>理论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>强 Kleene</td>\n<td>Kripke 固定点语义、KF 的预期模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱 Kleene</td>\n<td>传染式未定义语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超赋值</td>\n<td>对所有经典精确化量化的间隙语义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>部分逻辑的优点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>自然处理未定义情况</li>\n<li>区分“假”与“尚未定义”</li>\n<li>提供间隙的形式化框架</li>\n</ul>\n<p>部分逻辑的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>部分真理语义的一般框架</li>\n<li>处理语义悖论的标准工具</li>\n<li>真理间隙的形式化基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-partial-logic-—-部分逻辑-$\\mathrm{PartLog}$","text":"df-partial-logic — 部分逻辑 $\\mathrm{PartLog}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-strong-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-weak-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"bf50594cf0328bc9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-weak-kleene]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartLog}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{3}=\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf M=(\\mathbf 3,\\neg_{\\mathbf M},\\land_{\\mathbf M},\n\\lor_{\\mathbf M},D)","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\mathbf 3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartLog}(\\mathcal L,\\mathbf M,v)\\coloneqq\nv\\in\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathbf M}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\,\n\\bigl(\\vDash_{\\mathbf M,v}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow v(\\varphi)\\in D\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{t, f, u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\vDash_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\land \\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\land \\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}","display":false}],"bytes":2380,"backlinks":[{"id":"3f012d0f8371bf9a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2a6ae68f45ba9960","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-partial-logic]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91